00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:16.710
hamster wheel of trying to make content
and all you're doing is creating and

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:22.859
you're not living it's hard for you to
really connect to yourself and so after

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:26.580
I got to New York and I really kind of
started to settle my life I started to

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.359
